                      MultivaluedMap<String, String> headers, InputStream is)
            throws IOException {

        /* Create a fresh ParserOptions instance for each request.
         * This guarantees that the options are applied before parsing
         * and eliminates the need for synchronisation on the shared
         * Parser instance. */
        ParserOptions options = new ParserOptions();
        options.setAutodetectCharset(autodetectCharset);

        /* Explicitly disable entity resolution to mitigate XXE attacks.
         * The option is set on the ParserOptions object rather than
         * on the Parser itself, ensuring it takes effect for this
